  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Fostering Green Transition in Pet&#xE9;n TEI</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Fostering Green Transition in Pet&#xE9;n TEI</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Insatsen avser Sveriges st&#xF6;d till Team Europe Iniative i Guatemala - &quot;Fostering Green Transition in Pet&#xE9;n&quot;. Sverige str&#xE4;var efter att st&#xF6;dja TEI med parallell finansiering genom lokala partners Swisscontact och Conexion.  Swisscontact och Conexi&#xF3;n kommer att arbeta tillsammans i denna insats genom att gemensamt st&#xF6;dja Team Europe-initiativet, i syfte att st&#xF6;dja de fem komponenterna nedan p&#xE5; ett transversellt s&#xE4;tt - och d&#xE4;rigenom &#xE4;ven st&#xF6;dja de &#xF6;vergripande och specifika m&#xE5;len. 
Team Europe-initiativet syftar till den sociala och ekonomiska gr&#xF6;na omst&#xE4;llningen i makroregionen Pet&#xE9;n i Guatemala och skapandet av inkluderande h&#xE5;llbar och gr&#xF6;n syssels&#xE4;ttning, genom f&#xF6;ljande fem komponenter:
&#x2022;Component 1: Tillhandah&#xE5;lla kapacitetsutveckling till lokala institutioner. 
&#x2022;Komponent 2: Fr&#xE4;mja h&#xE5;llbar f&#xF6;rvaltning av skogssystem. 
&#x2022;Komponent 3: St&#xF6;dja klimatt&#xE5;ligt jordbruk.
&#x2022;Komponent 4: Uppmuntra h&#xE5;llbar turism. 
&#x2022;Komponent 5: F&#xF6;rb&#xE4;ttra hanteringen av avfall och avloppssystemen.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The contribution is Sweden&apos;s support to the Team Europe Iniative in Guatemala - &quot;Fostering Green Transition in Pet&#xE9;n&quot;. Sweden aims to support the TEI with parallel financing through local partners Swisscontact and Conexion. Swisscontact and Conexi&#xF3;n will work together in this contribution by jointly supporting the Team Europe Initiative, with the aim to support all the five components in the TEI in a transverse manner - and thereby supporting the outcomes of the overall and specific abovementioned objectives.
The Team Europe Initiative aims at the social and economic green transition of the Pet&#xE9;n macro region of Guatemala and the generation of inclusive sustainable and green employment, through the following five components.
&#x2022;	Component 1: Provide capacity development to local institutions. 
&#x2022;	Component 2: Foster sustainable management of forest systems. 
&#x2022;	Component 3: Assist climate resilient agriculture.
&#x2022;	Component 4: Encourage sustainable tourism. 
&#x2022;	Component 5: Improve solid waste management and sewage systems.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Overall Objective

To link socioeconomic development in the Department of Pet&#xE9;n with protection of the environment and sustainable use of natural resources with gender and cultural pertinence approach.&#xA0;

Specific Objectives (results) are:

1. Improve policy framework and financing for inclusive green economic development in Pet&#xE9;n

2. Increase sustainable production and productivity of agriculture, livestock, forestry and tourism

3. Improve waste and waste water&#xA0;management services in the municipalities of Pet&#xE9;n-Itz&#xE1; basin</narrative>
  </description>
